<title>UK: BNG sets 750 mln guilder Dec 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 11:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>BNG sets 750 mln guilder Dec 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 11:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Ing Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.DEC.03 (Corrects maturity date to 23.DEC.03 from 23.DEC.02.)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE   S15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.65     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.6	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
